msgstr ""
"Met deze optie schakelt u de AAC software decodering in.\n"
"\n"
"U kunt kiezen uit AAC ADTS of AAC LATM."

msgid "Turn on AC3 software decoding."
msgstr "Indien geactiveerd, dan schakelt u de AC3 software decodering in."

msgid "Turn on DTS software decoding."
msgstr "Indien geactiveerd, dan schakelt u de DTS software decodering in."

msgid "Turn on EAC3 software decoding."
